OpenLambda real-robot collection

This module provides source decoding, a checksummed record format, an MPEG-TS
timestamp parser, physical schema validation, offline nearest-source alignment,
a read-only ROS hand observer, and timestamped Parquet/MP4 export behind a
standalone CLI.

See the repository root LICENSE for Apache-2.0 terms. Upstream SONIC code,
hardware SDKs and model assets retain their respective licenses. No SONIC
weights, proprietary device SDK or collected demonstrations are included in
this module.
